WindowY0_L0|Layer 0 - Window Vertical Start|Windows Position||0|2047|Configures the Window vertical Start Position Window Y0.
WindowY1_L0|Layer 0 - Window Vertical Stop|Windows Position||0|2047|Configures the Window vertical Stop Position Window Y1.
