PixelSize_L0|Layer 0 - Pixel Size|Flexible ARGB||0|31|Specifies the ARGB Pixel size.
AlphaPos_L0|Layer 0 - Alpha Position|Flexible ARGB||0|31|Specifies the position of the Alpha component inside the pixel memory word (in bits)
RedPos_L0|Layer 0 - Red Position|Flexible ARGB||0|31|Specifies the position of the Red component inside the pixel memory word (in bits)
GreenPos_L0|Layer 0 - Green Position|Flexible ARGB||0|31|Specifies the position of the Green component inside the pixel memory word (in bits)
BluePos_L0|Layer 0 - Blue Position|Flexible ARGB||0|31|Specifies the position of the Blue component inside the pixel memory word (in bits)
AlphaWidth_L0|Layer 0 - Alpha Width|Flexible ARGB||0|15|Specifies the Width of the Alpha component in bits
RedWidth_L0|Layer 0 - Red Width|Flexible ARGB||0|15|Specifies the Width of the Red component in bits
GreenWidth_L0|Layer 0 - Green Width|Flexible ARGB||0|15|Specifies the Width of the Green component in bits
BlueWidth_L0|Layer 0 - Blue Width|Flexible ARGB||0|15|Specifies the Width of the Blue component in bits
