BlendingFactor2_L0|Layer 0 - Blending Factor2|Blending||||Select the blending factor 2. LTDC_BLENDING_FACTOR2_CA: blending factor is Alpha constant LTDC_BLENDING_FACTOR2_PAxCA: blending factor is Alpha constant x Pixel Alpha
